{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"edits\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S02-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他一想起那些好日子，就赶紧提醒自己当初受过的委屈，免得又想回去。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他想起从前大家总会自然地把他算上，心里竟有一阵很轻的欢喜。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S03-4\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他开始发愁：就算不用再受委屈，往后的日子又该怎么过？\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"这股不服气也渐渐淡下去，他只是静静难过，连替自己辩解的力气都没有了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"离开以后，遇上难受的事常常只能自己熬，他这才明白，从前有人在身边的日子有多不一样。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他很想再过那种不用多说、也不必担心自己被落下的日子，却明白未必还能回得去。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"刚才还像在眼前的旧日生活忽然远了，他又想起那个问题：如果早知道离开以后会这么孤单，当初还会不会走？\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S09-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他心里一沉，连继续想下去的力气都没有了。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-1\",\n      \"op\": \"delete\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他到底还是舍不得从前那些好日子，要说当初走得对，又没法说得那么干脆。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S10-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他翻来覆去想了这么久，还是想不出个所以然，只觉得不能再这样耗下去。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他也慢慢肯承认，从前那些好日子是真的好，当初受的委屈也是真的不该忍。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S12-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"这回他由着自己想了一会儿，心里舍不得，却没打算就这样回去。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-1\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"想到从前别人自然地把他当自己人，他心里又软又热。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-2\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得那段日子，也想把眼前的日子过好，盼着以后还能自在地和人相处。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-3\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"这股热切过后，他仍知道往后免不了孤单，至于什么时候才能再有那样的日子，他也说不准，心里慢慢安静下来。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S13-4\",\n      \"op\": \"replace\",\n      \"text\": \"可有一点他终于拿定了：哪怕以后真想回去，也不能再把那些委屈一口口咽下去，只为了还能和从前一样相处。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"note\": \"删去重复的自我辩护和中段回绕，明确S09重新浮现的孤单问题，调整S10的疲惫感，并把多处心理分析式表达改成更日常的讲述。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "38666bcf-e231-4c80-93b3-de8649e95a0a", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261103T065926410723Z", "elapsed_seconds": 597.875, "completed_utc": "2026-11-03T07:09:24.302639+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d3580b5996ef92b78ed456ed8dc35bee3875c44eeb31ee8aae7813bcebada0d9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261103T065926410723Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "041074902790d985bc35d319e72cd5cd9dfe31897c40723a879f4f66093f912e"}}}
